{"name": "Malignant Survivors 2", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras_big/0f1c536f3e763b50f72ace1dae52db47.webp?t=1787926545\" height=\"233\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/0f1c536f3e763b50f72ace1dae52db47.avif?t=1787926545\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Malignant Survivors 2 is a 3D horde roguelite with ARPG elements, and it's old-school and challenging. Only you will figure out how to solve problems and survive the madness, with the help of a bit of luck. Open chests, find boosts, run away, or charge into the horde; survive or die while experiencing the most crowded 3D combat ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/63ca1b66b847aaffe275380b1e2eadc5.poster.avif?t=1787926545\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/63ca1b66b847aaffe275380b1e2eadc5.webm?t=1787926545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/63ca1b66b847aaffe275380b1e2eadc5.mp4?t=1787926545\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The drops are not pre-designed; every barrel, every chest can drop anything. May the luck be with you.<br/>There are approx. 1000~ base items + 50~ prefixes (those prefixes add new affixes to the item on drop).<br/>** See what other people dropped on item leaderboards.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/7f335222667a03ad7c7887ff62c19d33.poster.avif?t=1787926545\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/7f335222667a03ad7c7887ff62c19d33.webm?t=1787926545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/7f335222667a03ad7c7887ff62c19d33.mp4?t=1787926545\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect crafting materials and upgrade/reroll your items with recipes. Results may surprise you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras_big/a811db033de6f367714960a16203664b.webp?t=1787926545\" height=\"942\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/a811db033de6f367714960a16203664b.avif?t=1787926545\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But... you will die, eventually. Try other heroes, different builds, and different tactics to survive the horde.<br/>If you are lucky and find a cool item on the run, maybe you can clear the realm with even a weaker build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/2bd23b259911d0a77e3b35bff6239d5f.poster.avif?t=1787926545\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/2bd23b259911d0a77e3b35bff6239d5f.webm?t=1787926545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/extras/2bd23b259911d0a77e3b35bff6239d5f.mp4?t=1787926545\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good luck, and enjoy.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Experience the most intense 3D crowd combat ever. Pick a hero, gear up and face the horde. Grab loot, get stronger and stay alive. Died? Try another hero, another build. Find your own path to the Abyss.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647190/d50a469314492ce75b793e191432da6543559a76/header.jpg?t=1787926545", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "RPG", "Roguelike", "Action Roguelike", "Dungeon Crawler", "Roguelite"], "developers": "Eren Aydin, Serhat Y\u00fccekaya", "publishers": "Eren Aydin, Serhat Y\u00fccekaya", "release_date": "Aug 28, 2026", "price": "$4.23", "appid": "3647190", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "1 May 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/rmd0rWGA1lU", "first_seen": 1777586400.0, "review_rank": 740}